{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40112","label":"ARK RANGER · Part 1"},"label":"Toward What Lies Beyond: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_arkranger1_01_e","next":"event_arkranger1_02_e","speakers":{"femaleannouncer":"Female Announcer","black":"Ark Ranger Black"},"icons":{"femaleannouncer":"si_c999_00_s","black":"si_c570_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_1","text":"The massive fire raging on Royal Road continues to intensify as we speak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BurningCity","bgArt":"burningcity","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_stormbreakers","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_2","text":"Shortly after the fire broke out, the flames rapidly spread to large amounts of flammable materials stored in the area, quickly escalating beyond control.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_3","text":"As of now, the fire remains completely out of control.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_4","text":"The situation on the ground remains extremely volatile.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_5","text":"The A.F.F. is struggling to reach the scene, hampered by narrow access roads leading to the fire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_6","text":"In an effort to prevent further damage, all nearby areas have been cordoned off, with the exception of access roads.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_7","text":"However, direct firefighting operations are being delayed due to the narrow passageways.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_8","text":"The situation is further complicated by large crowds that have gathered near the scene, obstructing the movement of fire engines and further hampering access.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_9","text":"In response, the Central Government has announced that in approximately five minutes,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_10","text":"it will begin forcibly clearing civilians blocking the roads, to secure access for emergency responders.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_11","text":"Authorities have stated that no compensation will be provided for any physical injuries incurred during this forced dispersal,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_12","text":"and strongly urge citizens to evacuate promptly and voluntarily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_13","text":"The cause of the fire has also been identified.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_14","text":"Investigators have confirmed that this was an act of retaliatory arson committed by a man who had previously purchased high-value goods at the location.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_15","text":"The suspect sought a refund two weeks after making the purchase,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_16","text":"but when the store refused, he claims to have felt humiliated, prompting him to carry out the arson.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_17","text":"At the scene of the fire...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["black"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_18","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_19","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_19","text":"Ark Ranger Black stands before a towering inferno.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_20","text":"She looks around at the people nearby. Some are stamping their feet in helplessness, while others cry out in anguish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_21","text":"Nikkes from the A.F.F. are scrambling at the scene.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_22","text":"And some people are watching her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_23","text":"Something burns deep within her chest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_24","text":"She turns back to the flames.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_25","text":"On the rooftop of a building, three figures scream for help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_26","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_26","text":"The raging blaze and billowing smoke threaten to swallow them whole.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_27","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_27","text":"Almost subconsciously, Ark Ranger Black finds herself running.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_28","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_28","text":"She presses the Transform Trigger on her wrist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_lastbullet","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_29","text":"Ark Ranger Black!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_30","text":"Transform!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_31","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_31","text":"Voices from behind try to stop her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_32","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_32","text":"At the same time, cheers erupt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_33","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_33","text":"Ark Ranger! Ark Ranger! Ark Ranger!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_34","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_34","text":"A sense of absolute power courses through Ark Ranger Black, as if she can do anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_35","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_35","text":"She runs toward the burning building,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_36","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_36","text":"and looks up at the people calling out from the rooftop.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_37","text":"It's too far for me to jump...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_38","text":"In that case...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_39","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_39","text":"Covering her face with both arms, Ark Ranger Black charges in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_40","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_40","text":"The entrance shatters with a crash.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ArkRuinIndoor","bgArt":"arkruinindoor","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_41","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_41","text":"The interior is already engulfed in flames. Her temperature sensors go haywire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_42","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_42","text":"Through her visor, she begins mapping the interior.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_43","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_43","text":"She spots the stairs and sprints toward them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Corridor","bgArt":"corridor","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_44","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_44","text":"*Bang!* *Bang!* *Bang!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_45","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_45","text":"Though her body is an ultralight model designed for action-heavy scenarios, it is still far heavier than a human's.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_46","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_46","text":"Every time she takes a step, the floor buckles and caves beneath her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_47","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_47","text":"She ignores it and keeps running. At the end of the stairway is a door.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_02_s_48","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_02_s_48","text":"She kicks it open and bursts onto the rooftop.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Roof_n","bgArt":"roof_n","i